#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/buses.md:10
msgid "Software buses and bounded bus protocols"
msgstr "软件总线与有界总线协议"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/buses.md:12
msgid ""
"These optional C11 components use already selected public I/O faces. The "
"caller owns static storage, serialized progress, finite deadlines, outer "
"resource lifetimes and recovery. No implicit worker or additional "
"configuration authority is created."
msgstr ""
"这些可选 C11 组件使用已选定的公共 I/O "
"接口。调用者负责静态存储、串行化推进、有限截止时间、外层资源生命周期和恢复。组件不创建隐式工作线程或额外配置权威。"

