#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/buses.md:25
msgid ""
"The optional component frames bounded packets over an already configured "
"asynchronous I2C endpoint. Its generated companion reuses existing endpoint "
"IDs; it does not qualify hardware SMBTYPE, timeout or ALERT operation. See "
"the [component contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/buses/smbus/README.md) for "
"`nexus_smbus_factory.h`, static binding and borrowing lifetimes."
msgstr ""
"此可选组件在已配置的异步 I2C 端点上封装有界包。其生成的配套文件复用现有端点 ID；不认定硬件 SMBTYPE、超时或 ALERT 操作的资格。有关"
" `nexus_smbus_factory.h`、静态绑定和借用寿命，参见[组件合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/buses/smbus/README.md)。"

